  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845782,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## Ø Story: A Haunting PlayStation 2 Adventure\n\nØ Story (Love Story) is a unique Japanese adventure interactive movie for the PlayStation 2, marking Enix’s debut on the console and a key part of Sony’s launch campaign in Japan. Players assume the role of a young man tragically killed in a motorcycle accident, only to be resurrected as a ghost by the angel of love, Ai. Given six days to win the affection of a young woman named Rina, he must navigate a compelling narrative filled with cultural nuances and unexpected twists.\n\nGameplay blends cinematic full-motion video sequences with interactive elements, allowing players to influence the story’s direction through choices made at key moments. Quick-time events, reminiscent of Shenmue, add a layer of urgency. Players can interact with the world by writing on various surfaces and even shooting arrows to glimpse Rina’s thoughts. A \"love meter\" dictates success, requiring players to fill it to 100% within the time limit. Be prepared for a visually ambitious, if occasionally flawed, experience featuring a cast of Japanese actresses and models, and a soundtrack by Konatsu Yuzunogi."
    },
